From: djsaunde <1245942+djsaunde@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:17:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/21] fast: G_LINE3D for F3DEX 1.x (ucode_f3dex_line3d)

F3DEX 1.x shares opcode 0xB5 between G_QUAD (F3DEX) and G_LINE3D (L3DEX).
Add a ucode_f3dex_line3d entry, the F3DEX table with 0xB5 decoded as
G_LINE3D, and GfxSpLine3D, which draws the line as a quad extruded
perpendicular to it on screen, 1.5 + width / 2 native pixels thick.
The enum value is appended so existing ucode ids stay stable.
